<text>
<p>DEC. 31,     SEP 30,    JUN 30,</p>
<p>				 (AMOUNTS IN THOUSANDS)</p>
<p>				THREE MONTHS	    SIX MONTHS</p>
<p>			   ENDED DECEMBER 31,  ENDED DECEMBER 31,</p>
<p>			   1996	  1995	  1996	 1995</p>
<p>NET INTEREST INCOME</p>
<p>			  17,313	16,020	34,712     32,040</p>
<p>   NET INCOME	  4,864	 3,910    4,032(A)	8,428</p>
<p>EARNINGS PER SHARE AFTER SAIF</p>
<p>  RECAPITALIZATION    0.21	  0.17	  0.17	 0.37</p>
