<p>  EQUIVALENTS   23,096,306  22,692,575  23,098,306 22,692,575</p>
<p>(A) Without the one-time SAIF recapitalization net income would have been approximately $9.2 million or $.40 cents per share for the six months ended December 31, 1996. SOURCE Northwest Savings Bank</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
